# Folder types

Named types for a `src` folder live in `src/types/<folder>.types.ts`. Import them from `@/types`.

- Good: `BottomBarScreen` in `src/types/navigation.types.ts`, imported with `from '@/types'`
- Bad: `export type BottomBarScreen` inside `src/navigation/customStackNavigator.tsx`

`<folder>` is the top-level folder under `src` (`src/navigation` → `navigation.types.ts`). If that file is missing, create it and re-export it from `src/types/index.ts`.

Do not add a mega `src/index.ts`.
